# Privacy Compliance Assessment Tool

📊 **Live App:** [Streamlit Deployment](https://privacy-compliance-projects-hyfic37uib8yu38v2ukzmk.streamlit.app/)

---

## Overview
This project is a **Privacy Compliance Assessment Dashboard** designed to help organizations evaluate their compliance posture under **DPDPA/GDPR**.  
It started as a Typeform checklist and evolved into a **Streamlit app** hosted on GitHub + Streamlit Cloud.

---

## Features
- ✅ Interactive questionnaire with **Yes / Partial / No** scoring  
- ✅ **Compliance percentage** calculation with progress bar  
- ✅ **Color-coded risk posture** (Green = Strong, Yellow = Moderate, Red = High Risk)  
- ✅ **Remediation guidance** shown in expandable sections  
- ✅ **Donut chart** visualization of compliance distribution  
- ✅ Built with **Streamlit, Pandas, OpenPyXL, Altair**  

